---
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 border-b border-zinc-200">
  <div class="w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-normal text-zinc-950 leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">
          Landing page cepat untuk bisnis Anda, data langsung masuk ke <span class="italic">Google Sheets</span>.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-sans">
          Halaman penawaran produk atau event yang ringan dibuka di smartphone, tanpa biaya langganan aplikasi form bulanan, dan otomatis mencatat data calon pembeli ke Google Sheets serta notifikasi WhatsApp.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="#lead-form"
            class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-white transition-all duration-150 bg-[#173e2d] hover:bg-[#112e22] rounded-md border border-[#112e22] shadow-sm active:translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <span>Mulai Konsultasi</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-200/80 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-150 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
              <path d="M6 3.5L10.5 8L6 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="#harga"
            class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-zinc-900 transition-all duration-150 bg-white hover:bg-[#faf9f6] rounded-md border border-zinc-300 shadow-sm active:translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <span>Lihat Pilihan Paket</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-150 font-serif italic text-sm">&darr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-zinc-200 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-zinc-950">0 IDR</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">Biaya Bulanan</div>
            <div class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">Database Google Sheets resmi milik akun Anda</div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-zinc-950">&lt; 1 Detik</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">Akses di Mobile</div>
            <div class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">Ringan dibuka dari iklan Instagram &amp; TikTok</div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-zinc-950">Instan</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 text-sm">Direct WhatsApp</div>
            <div class="text-zinc-500 text-xs">Follow-up prospek langsung dari smartphone</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] overflow-hidden">
          <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-zinc-200 bg-[#f8f9fa] flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-[#0f9d58]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14H7v-2h5v2zm5-4H7v-2h10v2zm0-4H7V7h10v2z"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 truncate flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span>Leads-Pemasaran-2026</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-normal hidden sm:inline">&bull; Disimpan di Drive</span>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[10px] text-zinc-500 pt-0.5">
                  <span>File</span>
                  <span>Edit</span>
                  <span>Tampilan</span>
                  <span>Sisipkan</span>
                  <span>Format</span>
                  <span>Data</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-medium bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-700 border border-zinc-200 shrink-0">
              <span>Google Sheets API v4</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-zinc-200 bg-white flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-500">
            <span class="font-sans font-medium text-zinc-400 text-xs">fx</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-300">|</span>
            <span class="truncate text-zinc-600 font-sans">=ARRAYFORMULA(FILTER(A2:F, A2:A&lt;&gt;&quot;&quot;))</span>
          </div>

          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="bg-[#f8f9fa] border-b border-zinc-200 text-[11px] text-zinc-500">
                  <th class="w-8 px-2 py-1.5 text-center font-normal border-r border-zinc-200 text-zinc-400">#</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium border-r border-zinc-200 min-w-[90px]">A &bull; Waktu</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium border-r border-zinc-200 min-w-[110px]">B &bull; Nama</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium border-r border-zinc-200 min-w-[110px]">C &bull; WhatsApp</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium border-r border-zinc-200 min-w-[130px]">D &bull; Paket</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium border-r border-zinc-200 min-w-[160px]">E &bull; Catatan Kebutuhan</th>
                  <th class="px-3 py-1.5 font-medium min-w-[80px]">F &bull; Sumber</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-100 text-zinc-700 font-sans">
                <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-50/60">
                  <td class="px-2 py-2 text-center text-zinc-400 bg-[#f8f9fa] border-r border-zinc-200 text-[10px]">1</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">12:44:10</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 font-medium text-zinc-900">Budi Santoso</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">0812****7890</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100">
                    <span class="inline-flex px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-medium bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200">Paket Bisnis + UTM</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">Promo produk akhir tahun</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-zinc-500">instagram</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-50/60">
                  <td class="px-2 py-2 text-center text-zinc-400 bg-[#f8f9fa] border-r border-zinc-200 text-[10px]">2</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">11:20:05</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 font-medium text-zinc-900">Siti Rahmadani</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">0857****1123</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100">
                    <span class="inline-flex px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-medium bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200">Paket Standar</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">Event webinar UMKM nasional</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-zinc-500">direct</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-50/60">
                  <td class="px-2 py-2 text-center text-zinc-400 bg-[#f8f9fa] border-r border-zinc-200 text-[10px]">3</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">09:15:42</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 font-medium text-zinc-900">Hendro Wijaya</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">0813****7741</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100">
                    <span class="inline-flex px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-medium bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200">Paket Bisnis + UTM</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">Katalog servis bengkel mobil</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-zinc-500">tiktok</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="bg-blue-50/30">
                  <td class="px-2 py-2 text-center text-blue-600 font-semibold bg-[#f8f9fa] border-r border-zinc-200 text-[10px]">4</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">08:30:18</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 font-medium text-zinc-950 relative outline outline-2 outline-blue-600 -outline-offset-1 bg-white">
                    <span>Aris Munandar</span>
                    <span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-blue-600"></span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">0819****3320</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100">
                    <span class="inline-flex px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-medium bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200">Paket Bisnis + UTM</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-zinc-100 text-zinc-600">Jasa konsultan arsitektur</td>
                  <td class="px-3 py-2 text-zinc-500">google</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <div class="px-4 py-2.5 border-t border-zinc-200 bg-[#f8f9fa] flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-zinc-500">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200 font-medium text-zinc-800 shadow-xs border-b-2 border-b-[#0f9d58]">
                <span>Sheet1</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-zinc-400 font-medium">+</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/sandbox-sheet" class="text-emerald-800 hover:text-emerald-950 font-medium hover:underline">
              Buka Sandbox Lengkap (10 Kolom) &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed pt-3 px-1 text-center sm:text-left">
          Setiap kali pengunjung mengisi form, baris baru langsung bertambah di Google Sheets Anda tanpa aplikasi perantara berbayar.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
